    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: A failure passes straight through a call, and here it has nowhere to go: the parameter's type says the lambda never fails.
    = help: Handle it inside the lambda with `… catch { … }`, or add `throws` to the parameter's type.
